t="Jonathan M. Gitlin · Oct 16, 2:03 PM" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="app.folio.launcher" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[53,581][639,634]" drawing-order="1" hint="" /><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="app.folio.launcher" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[53,676][1027,1224]" drawing-order="2" hint="" /><node index="3" text="Nine years after first trying to resurrect the Roadster, Tesla is apparently trying again. CEO Elon Musk might have relocated its HQ to Texas, but yet again he has returned to California’s showbiz industry to hawk his wares; last time it was a Hollywood back lot for the remote-controlled Cybercab demo, last night it was decades-old stunt technology to make a show car do tricks in the air." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="app.folio.launcher" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[53,1266][1027,1950]" drawing-order="3" hint="" /><node index="4" text="The new Roadster, we’re told, will be unlike anything else, although the angular, wedge-shaped styling owes more than a little to Giorgetto Giugiaro’s original Lotus Esprit—Musk is known to own a James Bond prop car—as well as the more recent Lamborghini Gallardo. At the rear are four giant exhaust pipes; these do not signal Tesla’s sudden embrace of hydrocarbons beyond those emitted by private aviation." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="app.folio.launcher" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[53,1992][1027,2400]" drawing-order="4" hint="" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></hierarchy>